OL,3,AHouthis say at least 25 killed in Saudi
OL,4,Aair strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FMedia linked to the Houthi movement in
OL,7,FYemen say that at least 25 people,
OL,8,Fincluding women and children, have been
OL,9,Fkilled in airstrikes by Saudi Arabia.
OL,11,FThere has been no comment from the
OL,12,FSaudi-led coalition backing the
OL,13,Finternationally recognised government
OL,14,Fin Yemen.
OL,16,FLive video footage on Al Masirah - a
OL,17,Ftelevision station run by the Houthis -
OL,18,Fhas shown rescuers pulling bodies out
OL,19,Fof the rubble of several buildings in
OL,20,Fal-Shariyah, a town to the east of the
OL,21,Fcapital, Sanaa.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
